# Public URL of Sam's High ROI JSON (array). Recommended: JSONBlob.
# Upload once, then paste the Location URL here. Portal revalidates every 60s.
# Example upload:
#   curl -i -X POST https://jsonblob.com/api/jsonBlob \
#     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#     -H "Accept: application/json" \
